{
  "//": [
    "The HisabKitab mark, traced from the supplied logo and fitted to cubic Beziers.",
    "This file is the ONE drawing of the mark: BrandMark.tsx renders it in the app and",
    "frontend/scripts/generate-brand-assets.js renders it into every PNG in assets/",
    "(launcher icon, adaptive icon, splash, favicon, notification icon). Change it here",
    "and re-run that script, or the in-app logo and the launcher icon drift apart.",
    "",
    "Units: the mark is 1000 wide with its origin at the stems' top-left corner. Each part",
    "carries the box it occupies, so it can be drawn and animated as its own layer.",
    "The white gaps where the ribbon crosses the stems are not drawn - they are the",
    "absence of paint, so they show whatever the mark sits on. The right stem's lower",
    "piece runs 3 units up under the ribbon so no hairline seam shows where they meet.",
    "",
    "blue fills the arm (a path with no paint) and is also the app's primary colour",
    "(theme/index.ts), so the UI matches the logo. A paint names a gradient in paints.",
    "",
    "splashShare is how much of the screen's width the mark spans on the splash: the",
    "native one scales splash-icon.png to the screen width, and AnimatedSplash draws the",
    "mark at the same share, so the hand-over from one to the other does not jump."
  ],
